{"server":"jp","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_04_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_04","title":"機械獣の咆哮","storyCode":"RI-4","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"76e18b74745c55754d2315340ce182f0f2e5723d5c2560119f56653f97e26164","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"向かう所敵なしのズゥママを見て、我慢ならなくなったガヴィルはステージに上がりズゥママに挑む。\n危うく敗れそうになったズゥママは切り札――機械の巨獣「ビッグ・アグリー」を持ち出した！","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリスの雑魚A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガハッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリスの雑魚B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"つ、強すぎる……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウダイ","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"やるじゃねぇか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アルナ","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"調子に乗るな、ズゥママ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アルナ","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"野郎ども、かかれ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"うう、さすがズゥママ、やっぱり強いです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"たった一人であんな大勢をやっつけちゃうなんて……並みのティアカウじゃ全然歯が立ちませんね。まるであのときのガヴィルさんみたいです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"彼女について、ずいぶん詳しいようだな。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。ズゥママとガヴィルさんは昔から、このあたりでは最強と呼ばれていましたから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"でも私の知ってる限り、ズゥママは一度もガヴィルさんに勝ったことないんですよ！"}]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、あんなに強い人はきっと外だと珍しいですよね！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、ガヴィルさんはもっと強いんですよ！"}]},{"label":"かっこいい女性だ。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん、確かにズゥママもかっこいいんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、ガヴィルさんはもっとかっこいいです！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィルさん、そうですよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ、ガヴィルさんは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、あれを見ろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"見間違いじゃなかったのか！　あいつは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"ホントに帰ってきたのね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"全員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィル！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"わああああ、ガヴィルさんが直接舞台に上がっちゃいました！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"久しぶりだな、ズゥママ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"今は、ユーネクテス族長って呼ぶべきか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィル、まさか戻ってくるとはな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、トミミに呼び戻されてな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ？　つーかお前もサルゴン語が話せんのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、勉強した。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……お前もこの言葉を使っているということは、これは外の言語で間違いなさそうだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……もう戻らないかと思っていたぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"戻ってくるさ。今だけじゃなくて、これからもな。ここはアタシの故郷だからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……大族長になるつもりか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、お前にも用があんだよ。用事の方は別に祭典が終わってからでも良かったんだけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"お前がこんなに強くなったのを見せつけられたら、いても立ってもいられなくてよ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は本当に外で医者になったのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"へっ、これでも外では有名なんだぜ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"意外だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"お前は最近どうなんだ？　前回の祭典は、機械弄りに夢中で参加しなかったが、今回出てきたってことはついに完成したのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"すぐに見せる。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ううう、ガヴィルさん、手は出さないって言ってたのに……"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"手を出してほしくなかったのか？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　そ、そんなことはありませんが、た、ただ……"}]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターも見入っていますね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"うう、確かにかっこいいんですけど、でも……"}]},{"label":"それでこそガヴィルだ。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"うう、そうは言いますけど……"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……相変わらず強いな、ガヴィル。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"へっ、お前もなかなかやるな、ズゥママ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、お前は自分の拳に頼りすぎだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"その拳でお前は多くを成し遂げた。だがそのせいで、お前は拳以外のものに頼ることを知らない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"それがお前の限界であり、ここにいる私たちの限界でもあるんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"なにわけわかんねぇこと言ってんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"そろそろ変わらねば、ということだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"「よいしょっ、よいしょっ」と規則正しい掛け声と共に、ジャングルから、なにやら大きなものが霊殿に近づいてきた。\n全容はまだ見えない。しかし、ゆっくりと、だが着実に「歩く」影からは、比類なき強さが伝わってくるようだった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"確かにお前は強い、ガヴィル。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは本当は、大族長になってから使うつもりだったのだが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"お前に勝つには、今ここで使わざるを得ないようだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"どちらにせよ、結果は同じだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"これからはあれが、私たちを変えていく。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"だから全然何言ってるかわかんねぇって！　つーか何が来ても、アタシは簡単には倒れねぇぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"いや、お前はいとも容易く蹂躙される。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……大祭司、照準、放て！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac12_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"なんだ、ありゃあ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"言った通りになっただろう？　ガヴィル。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、私の本来の目的はこいつでお前を倒すことじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"拳だけでは、未来は創れないんだよ、ガヴィル。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"これからは、機械の時代だ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["ガヴィル"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["トミミ"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["ユーネクテス"]}]}
